{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1159055-dragon-blooded-and-artifact-loot","id":1159055,"title":"Dragon-Blooded and Artifact Loot","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-11-15T10:40:41-08:00","id":1159055,"title":"Dragon-Blooded and Artifact Loot","content":"So my players recently fought a bunch of Realm Dragon-Blooded and ended up with a pile of artifacts which I now have to reconcile with the possibility of Evocations. What have you done in your games with this? Given DBs regular weapons? Made every DB weapon unique with Evocations? Should DBs have a charm similar to Glorious Solar Saber to avoid the problem? Curious about everyone's experience with this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/565-therian","name":"Therian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar565_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T10:55:38-08:00","id":1159063,"title":"","content":"Depends, does your circle really want to be hauling around a metric buttload of jade weapons which identifies them really easily to the Realm? You can bet the Realm finding out X number princes of the earth dieing will be on the hunt to investigate this. <br /> <br /> As to artifact uniqueness i would recommend looking at Arms of the Chosen for some guidance in that count, it\u2019s an amazing book and can\u2019t recommend it enough.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11967-saipjas","name":"Saipjas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"270"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T11:20:09-08:00","id":1159079,"title":"","content":"I've found the evocations to not be an issue. Because the true power of weapons is only revealed by XP, in my experience few players wanted to suddenly start spending tons of XP on something that wasn't really part of their character idea. <br /> <br /> The PCs in my game picked up a number of unique artefact weapons, but once everyone's got one if they want one (which 5 out of 7 did), the rest just got put in their manse.<br /> <br /> If you are worried about power level, just make them all level 3.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T11:54:51-08:00","id":1159098,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saipjas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1159055-dragon-blooded-and-artifact-loot?p=1159063#post1159063\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Depends, does your circle really want to be hauling around a metric buttload of jade weapons which identifies them really easily to the Realm? You can bet the Realm finding out X number princes of the earth dieing will be on the hunt to investigate this.<br /> <br /> As to artifact uniqueness i would recommend looking at Arms of the Chosen for some guidance in that count, it\u2019s an amazing book and can\u2019t recommend it enough.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah its really how good the write-ups are in Arms of the Chosen that makes me think about this. Just that every one of those jade weapons could have a story like the ones in Arms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/565-therian","name":"Therian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar565_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T13:55:18-08:00","id":1159169,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1159055-dragon-blooded-and-artifact-loot?p=1159079#post1159079\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've found the evocations to not be an issue. Because the true power of weapons is only revealed by XP, in my experience few players wanted to suddenly start spending tons of XP on something that wasn't really part of their character idea. <br /> <br /> <br /> The PCs in my game picked up a number of unique artefact weapons, but once everyone's got one if they want one (which 5 out of 7 did), the rest just got put in their manse.<br /> <br /> If you are worried about power level, just make them all level 3.</div> </div> </div> </div>To echo this, be upfront with your players and ask if they are interested, the game is designed to be open about this kind of thing so ask if they are interested in perusing relationships with their artifacts (in the bond type) because it\u2019s only from that that artifacts develop their evocations. As said by the devs in the Q&amp;A the evocations are maleable because their are supposed to reflect the player and it\u2019s relation with the artifact.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11967-saipjas","name":"Saipjas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"270"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T03:22:32-08:00","id":1159377,"title":"","content":"If they have followers or hench (or just friends and allies) that are essence-users they could be granted spare weapons for favors or rewards. Then make these people stuck to a place or send them off. Like garrisoning a city or sending them off with a message to X guildsman. These are just examples of course.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/854-light-hero","name":"light-hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar854_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"408"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}